# East has a double and a triple tap: three quick taps fire only the triple.
setup tests/scenarios/packs/input.padpack Gestures
tap east 30
advance 50
tap east 30
advance 50
tap east 30
advance 400
tap east 30
advance 50
tap east 30
advance 400
---
key KEY_G down @160
key KEY_G up   @190
key KEY_F down @950
key KEY_F up   @950
